:HELP NAME=CHGLINETH.Change Line Desc (Ethernet) (CHGLINETH)
:P.Use the Change Line Desc (Ethernet) (CHGLINETH) command to change an
Ethernet line description; what is not given stays as it was.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/LIND'.Line description (LIND)
:P.The line description.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/RSRCNAME'.Resource name (RSRCNAME)
:P.The hardware resource name, as WRKHDWRSC shows it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *AGG, *NWSD.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/BRIDGE'.Bridge identifier (BRIDGE)
:P.The bridge identifier for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/ONLINE'.Online at IPL (ONLINE)
:P.Whether the device or line is varied on when the system starts (IPL).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.It is varied on at IPL.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.It stays varied off until someone varies it on.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/VRYWAIT'.Vary on wait (VRYWAIT)
:P.The vary on wait for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 15 to 180.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *NOWAIT.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/AGGPCY'.Aggregate policy (AGGPCY)
:P.The aggregate policy for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:EPARML.
:P.The value has 2 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. Standard
:P.Also accepted&colon. *ETHCHL, *LNKAGG.
:H4.Part 2&colon. Policy type
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *SRCPORT, *DESTPORT, *SRCDESTP, *RNDRBN.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/AGGRSCL'.Aggregated resource list (AGGRSCL)
:P.The aggregated resource list for this command.
:P.Up to 8 values can be given.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/ASSOCPORT'.Associated port resource name (ASSOCPORT)
:P.The associated port resource name for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/ADPTADR'.Local adapter address (ADPTADR)
:P.The local adapter address for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 12 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *ADPT.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/EXCHID'.Exchange identifier (EXCHID)
:P.The exchange identifier for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 8 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/GRPADR'.Group address (GRPADR)
:P.The group address for this command.
:P.Up to 12 values can be given.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 12 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/SSAP'.SSAP list (SSAP)
:P.The SSAP list for this command.
:P.Up to 24 values can be given.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*SYSGEN:EPK.
:PD.The value the system generates.
:EPARML.
:P.The value has 3 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. Source service access point
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 2 characters.
:EPARML.
:H4.Part 2&colon. SSAP maximum frame
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 265 to 8996.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *MAXFRAME.
:H4.Part 3&colon. SSAP type
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*CALC:EPK.
:PD.The system calculates the value.
:PT.:PK.*SNA:EPK.
:PD.SNA.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *NONSNA, *HPR.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/LINESPEED'.Line speed (LINESPEED)
:P.The line speed for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*AUTO:EPK.
:PD.Chosen automatically.
:EPARML.
:P.The value must be 10M, 100M, 1G, 10G, 25G, 100G.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/DUPLEX'.Duplex (DUPLEX)
:P.Whether the output prints on both sides of the paper.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*FULL:EPK.
:PD.Full.
:PT.:PK.*AUTO:EPK.
:PD.Chosen automatically.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *HALF.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/SRVOPT'.Serviceability options (SRVOPT)
:P.The serviceability options for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 5 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/MAXFRAME'.Maximum frame size (MAXFRAME)
:P.The maximum frame size for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1496 to 8996.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/MAXCTL'.Maximum controllers (MAXCTL)
:P.The maximum controllers for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 256.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/AUTOCRTCTL'.Autocreate controller (AUTOCRTCTL)
:P.The autocreate controller for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/AUTODLTCTL'.Autodelete controller (AUTODLTCTL)
:P.The autodelete controller for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 10000.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/CMNRCYLMT'.Recovery limits (CMNRCYLMT)
:P.The recovery limits for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*SYSVAL:EPK.
:PD.The value of the system value that holds the default.
:EPARML.
:P.The value has 2 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. Count limit
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 0 to 99.
:EPARML.
:P.When no value is given, 2 is used.
:H4.Part 2&colon. Time interval
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 0 to 120.
:EPARML.
:P.When no value is given, 5 is used.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/MSGQ'.Message queue (MSGQ)
:P.The message queue that receives the messages the command or the
object sends.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*SYSVAL:EPK.
:PD.The value of the system value that holds the default.
:PT.:PK.*SYSOPR:EPK.
:PD.QSYSOPR, the system operator's message queue.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/THRESHOLD'.Error threshold level (THRESHOLD)
:P.The error threshold level for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*OFF:EPK.
:PD.Off.
:PT.:PK.*MIN:EPK.
:PD.The smallest value.
:PT.:PK.*MAX:EPK.
:PD.The largest value.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *MED.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/GENTSTFRM'.Generate test frame (GENTSTFRM)
:P.The generate test frame for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLINETH/TEXT'.Text 'description' (TEXT)
:P.A short description of the object, up to 50 characters, shown by the
work-with and display commands next to its name.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The text does not change.
:PT.:PK.*BLANK:EPK.
:PD.No text.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 50 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CRTLINETH.Create Line Desc (Ethernet) (CRTLINETH)
:P.Use the Create Line Desc (Ethernet) (CRTLINETH) command to describe
